{"id":"CVE-2022-25866","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"snyk","published":"2022-04-25T17:10:10.912Z","updated":"2024-09-16T16:38:31.811Z","title":"Command Injection","description":"The package czproject/git-php before 4.0.3 are vulnerable to Command Injection via git argument injection. When calling the isRemoteUrlReadable($url, array $refs = NULL) function, both the url and refs parameters are passed to the git ls-remote subcommand in a way that additional flags can be set. The additional flags can be used to perform a command injection.","cwe":["Command Injection"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":8.1,"sev":"HIGH","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H/E:P"}],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"czproject/git-php","versions":["affected unspecified <4.0.3 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-PHP-CZPROJECTGITPHP-2421349","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/czproject/git-php/commit/5e82d5479da5f16d37a915de4ec55e1ac78de733","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/czproject/git-php/releases/tag/v4.0.3","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"credits":["Alessio Della Libera of Snyk Research Team"],"vendors":["php"]}
