{"id":"CVE-2022-31630","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"php","published":"2022-11-14T06:53:06.774Z","updated":"2024-08-03T07:26:01.044Z","title":"OOB read due to insufficient input validation in imageloadfont()","description":"In PHP versions prior to 7.4.33, 8.0.25 and 8.1.12, when using imageloadfont() function in gd extension, it is possible to supply a specially crafted font file, such as if the loaded font is used with imagechar() function, the read outside allocated buffer will be used. This can lead to crashes or disclosure of confidential information. ","cwe":["CWE-131 CWE-131 Incorrect Calculation of Buffer Size","CWE-190 CWE-190 Integer Overflow or Wraparound"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":6.5,"sev":"MEDIUM","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:N/A:L"}],"affected":[{"vendor":"PHP Group","product":"PHP","repo":"https://github.com/php/php-src","defaultStatus":"unaffected","modules":["gd"],"versions":["affected 7.4.x <7.4.33 (custom)","affected 8.0.x <8.0.25 (custom)","affected 8.1.x <8.1.12 (custom)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=81739"}],"configurations":["gd extension"],"credits":["cmb@php.net","cmb@php.net"],"vendors":["php"]}
{"id":"CVE-2022-31631","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"php","published":"2025-02-12T22:10:45.418Z","updated":"2025-02-13T16:06:41.825Z","title":"PDO::quote() may return unquoted string","description":"In PHP versions 8.0.* before 8.0.27, 8.1.* before 8.1.15, 8.2.* before 8.2.2 when using PDO::quote() function to quote user-supplied data for SQLite, supplying an overly long string may cause the driver to incorrectly quote the data, which may further lead to SQL injection vulnerabilities.","cwe":["CWE-74 CWE-74 Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Output Used by a Downstream Component ('Injection')"],"metrics":[{"src":"cna","v":"3.1","score":9.1,"sev":"CRITICAL","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N"},{"src":"CISA-ADP","ssvc":{"Exploitation":"poc","Automatable":"yes","Technical Impact":"total"}}],"affected":[{"vendor":"PHP Group","product":"PHP","packageName":"pdo_sqlite","defaultStatus":"affected","versions":["affected 8.0.x <8.0.27 (semver)","affected 8.1.x <8.1.15 (semver)","affected 8.2.x <8.2.2 (semver)"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=81740"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20230223-0007/"}],"vendors":["php"]}
